<h4 class="center">What Is Vivid Management System (V3)?</h4>
<p class="gameInfoText">
    The Vivid Management System (VMS) is a proprietary application for Vivid Property Services (Vivid). 
    It is designed to assist Vivid employees with their administrative tasks on all levels, whether 
    they track their KPIs and metrics on the operation level or carry out customer support by organising
    Work Orders.
</p>
<div class="underline"></div>
<h4 class="center">Key Contributions</h4>
<p class="gameInfoText">
    The system is being rebuilt from the ground up due to the impossibility of maintaining the old version.
    This new version, dubbed Version 3 (V3), was designed with an MVC pattern as a Content Management System (CMS).
    My role at Vivid is to help transfer the old modules of VMS into V3.
</p>
<div class="gameInfoBlock">
<ul>
    <li>Redesigned and created a user-friendly Form Builder to allow Vivid Employees to create dynamic Audit forms to assess our cleaning duties</li>
    <li>Integrated the FusionCharts JavaScript library to create powerful business intelligence charts & created a dynamic GUI to easily create advanced charts using this framework</li>
    <li>Implemented real-time AutoSaving for user audits on the field with jQuery, ColdFusion and JavaScript</li>
    <li>Incorporated multiple RESTful APIs for supply chain ordering of consumable items (e.g. soap, tissues etc.)</li>
